msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust Statistics"
msgstr "ロバスト統計"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust versions of classical statistical analyses"
msgstr "伝統的な統計分析のロバスト版"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust Classical Analyses"
msgstr "ロバストな伝統的分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust ANOVA"
msgstr "ロバスト分散分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust Repeated Measures ANOVA"
msgstr "ロバスト反復測定分散分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust ANCOVA"
msgstr "ロバスト共分散分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust Linear Regression"
msgstr "ロバスト線形回帰"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust Correlation"
msgstr "ロバスト相関"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid ""
"Robust ANCOVA compares trimmed means of exactly two groups while adjusting "
"for a covariate, using a nonparametric running interval smoother. No "
"parametric assumptions about homogeneity of regression slopes or equal "
"variances are required. Without a covariate, a robust one-way ANOVA is "
"performed instead."
msgstr ""
"ロバスト共分散分析では、ノンパラメトリックな移動区間平滑化(running interval "
"smoother)を使って共変量を調整しながら、ちょうど2つの群のトリム平均を比較しま"
"す。回帰の傾きの等質性や等分散について、パラメトリックな仮定は必要ありませ"
"ん。共変量がない場合は、代わりにロバストな一元配置分散分析を行います。"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "仮定"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "The independent variable is categorical with exactly two levels."
msgstr "独立変数は、水準がちょうど2つのカテゴリカル変数です。"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "The dependent variable and covariate are continuous."
msgstr "従属変数と共変量は連続変数です。"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "The groups are independent."
msgstr "群は互いに独立です。"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "Dependent Variable"
msgstr "従属変数"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "The continuous outcome variable."
msgstr "連続な結果変数です。"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "Fixed Factor"
msgstr "固定要因"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "A categorical grouping variable with exactly two levels."
msgstr "水準がちょうど2つの、カテゴリカルなグループ化変数です。"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "Covariate"
msgstr "共変量"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "An optional continuous covariate to adjust for."
msgstr "調整に使う連続な共変量です(省略可)。"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "Additional Statistics"
msgstr "その他の統計"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "Descriptives"
msgstr "記述統計量"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid ""
"Per-group sample size, trimmed mean, median, Winsorized standard deviation, "
"and median absolute deviation for the dependent variable and each covariate."
msgstr ""
"従属変数と各共変量について、群ごとのサンプルサイズ、トリム平均、中央値、ウィ"
"ンザー化標準偏差、中央絶対偏差を表示します。"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid ""
"Robust Repeated Measures ANOVA analyzes differences between dependent group "
"means using robust methods from the WRS2 package. No assumptions of "
"normality, homogeneity, or sphericity are required."
msgstr ""
"ロバスト反復測定分散分析では、WRS2パッケージのロバストな方法を使って、対応の"
"ある群の平均の差を分析します。正規性、等質性、球面性の仮定は必要ありません。"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "仮定"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "The dependent variable is continuous."
msgstr "従属変数は連続変数です。"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "The observations within each subject are dependent (repeated measures)."
msgstr "各参加者の中の観測は互いに依存しています(反復測定)。"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "Repeated Measures Factor"
msgstr "反復測定要因"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid ""
"The within-subjects (repeated measures) variable. Define one factor and "
"label its levels. Robust RM ANOVA currently supports a single within-"
"subjects factor."
msgstr ""
"参加者内(反復測定)の変数です。要因を1つ定義し、その水準に名前を付けます。ロバ"
"スト反復測定分散分析は、現在のところ参加者内要因を1つだけ扱えます。"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "RM Factor"
msgstr "反復測定要因"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "Repeated Measures Cells"
msgstr "反復測定のセル"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid ""
"The separate columns in the data frame that represent the levels of the "
"repeated measure(s) factor(s)."
msgstr "反復測定要因の水準を表す、データフレーム上の個々の列です。"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "Between Subject Factor"
msgstr "参加者間要因"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "Optional single between-subjects grouping variable for mixed designs."
msgstr "混合計画のための、参加者間のグループ化変数です(1つまで・省略可)。"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "Additional Statistics"
msgstr "その他の統計"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "Descriptives"
msgstr "記述統計量"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid ""
"Per-cell sample size, trimmed mean, median, Winsorized standard deviation, "
"and median absolute deviation across the within-subjects (and optional "
"between-subjects) factor levels."
msgstr ""
"参加者内要因(と、指定した場合は参加者間要因)の水準ごとに、セルごとのサンプル"
"サイズ、トリム平均、中央値、ウィンザー化標準偏差、中央絶対偏差を表示します。"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid ""
"Robust ANOVA analyzes differences between group means using robust methods "
"from the WRS2 package. These methods do not assume normality or homogeneity "
"of variances."
msgstr ""
"ロバスト分散分析では、WRS2パッケージのロバストな方法を使って、群平均の差を分"
"析します。これらの方法は、正規性や分散の等質性を仮定しません。"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "仮定"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid ""
"The independent variables are categorical, the dependent variable is "
"continuous."
msgstr "独立変数はカテゴリカル変数、従属変数は連続変数です。"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "The groups are independent."
msgstr "群は互いに独立です。"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "Dependent Variable"
msgstr "従属変数"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "The continuous outcome variable."
msgstr "連続な結果変数です。"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "Fixed Factors"
msgstr "固定要因"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid ""
"The categorical grouping variables. Trimmed means support up to three "
"factors; medians support up to two; the bootstrap method supports a single "
"factor (one-way) only."
msgstr ""
"カテゴリカルなグループ化変数です。トリム平均では要因を3つまで、中央値では2つ"
"まで扱えます。ブートストラップ法は要因1つ(一元配置)だけに対応しています。"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "Additional Statistics"
msgstr "その他の統計"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "Descriptives"
msgstr "記述統計量"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid ""
"Per-cell sample size, trimmed (or untrimmed) mean, median, Winsorized "
"standard deviation, and median absolute deviation."
msgstr ""
"セルごとのサンプルサイズ、トリム平均(またはトリミングしない平均)、中央値、"
"ウィンザー化標準偏差、中央絶対偏差を表示します。"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "Robust effect sizes"
msgstr "ロバストな効果量"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid ""
"Algina-Keselman-Penfield robust standardised mean differences (ξ) for each "
"pair of factor levels. Computed via WRS2::akp.effect on a one-way design."
msgstr ""
"要因の水準の対ごとに、Algina-Keselman-Penfieldのロバストな標準化平均差(ξ)を表"
"示します。一元配置のデザインで WRS2::akp.effect により計算します。"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Descriptives Plots"
msgstr "記述統計プロット"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid ""
"To create a descriptive plot, select the independent variable to be placed "
"on the horizontal axis. If there are more than one independent variable, "
"they can be visualized in a single plot by placing the second variable in "
"'Separate Lines,' or visualized in separate plots by placing the variable in "
"'Separate Plots'."
msgstr ""
"記述統計量プロットを作るには、横軸に置く独立変数を選びます。独立変数が2つ以上"
"ある場合は、2つ目の変数を「分割線」に入れれば1つのプロットにまとめて描けます"
"し、「分割プロット」に入れればプロットを分けて描けます。"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr "要因"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "The independent variables included in the analysis."
msgstr "分析に含まれる独立変数です。"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Horizontal Axis"
msgstr "横軸"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid ""
"Select the independent variable that should be displayed on the horizontal "
"axis of the plot."
msgstr "プロットの横軸に表示する独立変数を選びます。"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Separate Lines"
msgstr "分割線"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid ""
"By placing an independent variable in this box, different lines "
"corresponding to the different levels of the independent variable will be "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"このボックスに独立変数を入れると、その独立変数の水準ごとに異なる線が表示され"
"ます。"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Separate Plots"
msgstr "分割プロット"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid ""
"By placing an independent variable in this box, different plots "
"corresponding to the different levels of the independent variable will be "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"このボックスに独立変数を入れると、その独立変数の水準ごとに異なるプロットが表"
"示されます。"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Display"
msgstr "表示"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Error bars"
msgstr "エラーバー"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid ""
"Display error bars in the plot. The error bars can represent either "
"confidence intervals or standard errors."
msgstr ""
"プロットにエラーバーを表示します。エラーバーは信頼区間か標準誤差のどちらかを"
"表せます。"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Confidence interval"
msgstr "信頼区間"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Standard error"
msgstr "標準誤差"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Normalize error bars"
msgstr "エラーバーを正規化"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid "Post Hoc Tests"
msgstr "事後検定"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid ""
"Perform pairwise comparisons between group levels using robust methods. The "
"specific post hoc function is determined by the selected robust method (e."
"g., lincon for trimmed means, mcppb20 for bootstrap)."
msgstr ""
"ロバストな方法で、群の水準の対ごとの比較を行います。どの事後検定の関数を使う"
"かは、選んだロバストな方法で決まります(例: トリム平均なら lincon、ブートスト"
"ラップなら mcppb20)。"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid "Correction"
msgstr "補正"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid ""
"To correct for multiple comparisons, various methods are available for "
"adjusting the p-value. Note: corrections are applied when supported by the "
"chosen robust post hoc method."
msgstr ""
"多重比較を補正するため、p値を調整する方法をいくつか選べます。注意: 補正は、選"
"んだロバストな事後検定の方法が対応している場合に適用されます。"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid "Hochberg"
msgstr "ホッホベルグ(Hochberg)"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid ""
"Hochberg's (1988) sharper Bonferroni procedure. This is the default "
"correction used by WRS2's lincon function."
msgstr ""
"Hochberg(1988)による、ボンフェローニ法を鋭くした手続きです。WRS2の lincon 関"
"数で既定として使われる補正です。"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid "Bonferroni"
msgstr "ボンフェローニ(Bonferroni)"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid ""
"This correction is considered conservative. The risk of Type I error is "
"reduced, however the statistical power decreases as well."
msgstr ""
"この補正は保守的とされます。第1種の誤りのリスクは減りますが、統計的検出力も下"
"がります。"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid "Holm"
msgstr "ホルム(Holm)"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid ""
"Also called sequential Bonferroni, and considered less conservative than the "
"Bonferroni method."
msgstr ""
"逐次ボンフェローニとも呼ばれ、ボンフェローニ(Bonferroni)法より保守的でないと"
"されます。"

msgctxt "PostHocDisplay|"
msgid "Display"
msgstr "表示"

msgctxt "PostHocDisplay|"
msgid "Confidence intervals"
msgstr "信頼区間"

msgctxt "PostHocDisplay|"
msgid ""
"When this option is selected, the confidence interval for the trimmed mean "
"difference is displayed."
msgstr "このオプションを選ぶと、トリム平均の差の信頼区間を表示します。"

msgctxt "PostHocDisplay|"
msgid "Flag significant comparisons"
msgstr "有意な比較に印を付ける"

msgctxt "PostHocDisplay|"
msgid "Add asterisks to the table to indicate 3 levels of significance."
msgstr "有意性の3段階を示すアスタリスクを表に付けます。"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Residuals"
msgstr "残差"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "統計量"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Displays descriptive statistics of the residuals and predicted values."
msgstr "残差と予測値の記述統計を表示します。"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Casewise diagnostics"
msgstr "ケースワイズ診断"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid ""
"Provides casewise diagnostics for residuals, displaying cases above a "
"threshold based on standardized residuals (default: 3) or Cook's distance "
"(default: 1), or displaying all cases."
msgstr ""
"残差についてのケースワイズ診断を提供します。標準化残差(既定は3)またはクックの"
"距離(既定は1)の閾値を超えるケースを表示するか、すべてのケースを表示します。"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Std. residual >"
msgstr "標準化残差 >"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Cook's dist. >"
msgstr "クックの距離 >"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "All"
msgstr "すべて"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "DFBETAS"
msgstr "DFBETAS"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid ""
"The difference between a parameter estimated using all cases and estimated "
"when one case is excluded. Indicated in the table when the absolute value of "
"DFBETAS is greater than 1."
msgstr ""
"すべてのケースを使って推定したパラメータと、1つのケースを除いて推定したパラ"
"メータとの差です。DFBETASの絶対値が1を超える場合に表に示されます。"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "DFFITS"
msgstr "DFFITS"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid ""
"The difference between the predicted value for a case when the model is "
"estimated including or excluding that case. Indicated in the table when the "
"absolute value of DFFITS is greater than 3 * sqrt(k/(n-k))."
msgstr ""
"そのケースを含めてモデルを推定した場合と、除いて推定した場合とで、そのケース"
"の予測値がどれだけ変わるかを表します。DFFITSの絶対値が 3 * sqrt(k/(n-k)) を超"
"える場合に表に示されます。"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Cov ratio"
msgstr "共分散比"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid ""
"The degree to which a case influences the variance of the regression "
"parameters. Indicated in the table when the covariance ratio is greater than "
"3 * k/(n-k)."
msgstr ""
"そのケースが回帰パラメータの分散にどれだけ影響するかを表します。共分散比が 3 "
"* k/(n-k) を超える場合に表に示されます。"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Leverage"
msgstr "てこ比"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid ""
"The influence of the observed value of the outcome variable over the "
"predicted values. Indicated in the table when the leverage is greater than 3 "
"* k/n."
msgstr ""
"結果変数の観測値が予測値に及ぼす影響です。てこ比が 3 * k/n を超える場合に表に"
"示されます。"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Mahalanobis"
msgstr "マハラノビス"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid ""
"Measures the distance of cases from the mean(s) of the predictor variable(s)."
msgstr "予測変数の平均からの、各ケースの距離を測ります。"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid "Raincloud Plots"
msgstr "雨雲プロット"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr "要因"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid "The independent variables included in the analysis."
msgstr "分析に含まれる独立変数です。"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid "Horizontal Axis"
msgstr "横軸"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid ""
"Select the independent variable that should be displayed on the horizontal "
"axis of the plot."
msgstr "プロットの横軸に表示する独立変数を選びます。"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid "Separate Plots"
msgstr "分割プロット"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid ""
"By placing an independent variable in this box, different plots "
"corresponding to the different levels of the independent variable will be "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"このボックスに独立変数を入れると、その独立変数の水準ごとに異なるプロットが表"
"示されます。"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid "Horizontal display"
msgstr "水平方向の表示"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid ""
"Changes the orientation of the raincloud difference plot so that the x-axis "
"represents the dependent variable."
msgstr "雨雲差プロットの向きを変えて、x軸が従属変数を表すようにします。"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid "Label y-axis"
msgstr "Y軸のラベル"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid ""
"Specify the robust estimation method and its parameters. All methods are "
"based on the WRS2 package."
msgstr ""
"ロバストな推定の方法とそのパラメータを指定します。どの方法もWRS2パッケージに"
"基づきます。"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid ""
"Trimmed Means: Uses a heteroscedastic ANOVA based on trimmed means (Welch-"
"type generalization)."
msgstr ""
"トリム平均: トリム平均に基づく、不等分散を許す分散分析を用います(Welch型の一"
"般化)。"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid ""
"Trimmed Means + Bootstrap: A percentile t-bootstrap version of the trimmed "
"means test."
msgstr ""
"トリム平均 + ブートストラップ: トリム平均の検定の、パーセンタイルtブートスト"
"ラップ版です。"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid ""
"Medians: A heteroscedastic ANOVA based on medians using the Harrell-Davis "
"estimator."
msgstr ""
"中央値: Harrell-Davis推定量を用いた、中央値に基づく不等分散を許す分散分析で"
"す。"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "Select the robust estimation method to use for the analysis."
msgstr "分析に使うロバストな推定の方法を選びます。"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "Trimmed Means"
msgstr "トリム平均"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "Trimmed Means + Bootstrap"
msgstr "トリム平均 + ブートストラップ"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "Medians"
msgstr "中央値"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "Trimming proportion"
msgstr "トリミングの割合"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid ""
"The proportion of observations to trim from each tail. Default is 0.2 (20%% "
"trimming)."
msgstr ""
"両側の裾からそれぞれトリミングする観測値の割合です。既定は0.2(20%%のトリミン"
"グ)です。"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "Bootstrap samples"
msgstr "ブートストラップサンプル"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "The number of bootstrap resamples to use. Default is 599."
msgstr "使うブートストラップの再標本の数です。既定は599です。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Robust correlation computes percentage bend or Winsorized correlations (WRS2 "
"package). These methods are resistant to outliers that can distort Pearson's "
"r.\n"
msgstr ""
"ロバスト相関では、パーセンテージ・ベンド相関またはウィンザー化相関を計算しま"
"す(WRS2パッケージ)。これらの方法は、ピアソンのrを歪めうる外れ値に対して頑健で"
"す。\n"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "仮定"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "変数"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Two or more continuous variables. All pairwise robust correlations are "
"reported."
msgstr "2つ以上の連続変数です。すべての対についてロバスト相関を表示します。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Options"
msgstr "オプション"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Percentage bend correlation downweights values in the tails. Winsorized "
"correlation replaces extreme values with less extreme ones before computing "
"the correlation."
msgstr ""
"パーセンテージ・ベンド相関は、裾にある値の重みを小さくします。ウィンザー化相"
"関は、相関を計算する前に極端な値をそれほど極端でない値に置き換えます。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Percentage bend"
msgstr "パーセンテージ・ベンド"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Winsorized"
msgstr "ウィンザー化"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Trimming proportion"
msgstr "トリミングの割合"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Bending constant β for percentage bend correlation, or Winsorization "
"proportion for the Winsorized correlation. Also used for the descriptives "
"table. Default is 0.2."
msgstr ""
"パーセンテージ・ベンド相関ではベンド定数β、ウィンザー化相関ではウィンザー化の"
"割合です。記述統計量の表にも使います。既定は0.2です。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Sample size"
msgstr "サンプルサイズ"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Display the number of complete pairwise observations used in each "
"correlation."
msgstr "各相関の計算に使った、対ごとに欠測のない観測の数を表示します。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Flag significant correlations"
msgstr "有意な相関のフラグを立てる"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Append asterisks to correlations whose p-value is below 0.05 (*), 0.01 (**), "
"or 0.001 (***)."
msgstr ""
"p値が0.05未満(*)、0.01未満(**)、0.001未満(***)の相関にアスタリスクを付けま"
"す。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Descriptives"
msgstr "記述統計量"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Per-variable sample size, trimmed mean, median, Winsorized standard "
"deviation, and median absolute deviation."
msgstr ""
"変数ごとのサンプルサイズ、トリム平均、中央値、ウィンザー化標準偏差、中央絶対"
"偏差を表示します。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Alternative hypothesis"
msgstr "対立仮説"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Specify the directional hypothesis used to compute the p-value of each "
"correlation."
msgstr "各相関のp値を計算するのに使う、方向についての仮説を指定します。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Correlated (two-sided)"
msgstr "相関(両側)"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Test whether the correlation differs from zero in either direction."
msgstr "相関がどちらかの向きに0と異なるかを検定します。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Positively correlated"
msgstr "正の相関"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Test whether the correlation is greater than zero."
msgstr "相関が0より大きいかを検定します。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Negatively correlated"
msgstr "負の相関"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Test whether the correlation is less than zero."
msgstr "相関が0より小さいかを検定します。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "プロット"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Scatter plots"
msgstr "散布図"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Displays scatter plots with marginal density plots and a linear regression "
"line for each pair of variables."
msgstr ""
"変数の対ごとに、周辺密度プロットと線形回帰直線を付けた散布図を表示します。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Robust linear regression uses M-estimation (MASS::rlm) to fit a linear model "
"that is resistant to outliers. Unlike OLS, it iteratively downweights "
"observations with large residuals.\n"
msgstr ""
"ロバスト線形回帰では、M推定(MASS::rlm)を使って、外れ値に対して頑健な線形モデ"
"ルを当てはめます。最小二乗法とは異なり、残差の大きい観測の重みを反復的に小さ"
"くします。\n"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "仮定"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Dependent Variable"
msgstr "従属変数"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "The continuous outcome variable to be regressed on the predictors."
msgstr "予測変数で回帰する、連続な結果変数です。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Covariates"
msgstr "共変量"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Continuous predictors entered as numeric covariates."
msgstr "数値の共変量として投入する連続な予測変数です。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr "要因"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Categorical predictors. Each factor is dummy coded with the first level as "
"the reference."
msgstr ""
"カテゴリカルな予測変数です。各要因は、最初の水準を基準としてダミーコード化さ"
"れます。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Estimation method"
msgstr "推定方法"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Huber downweights outliers gradually. Bisquare (Tukey) can fully reject "
"extreme outliers. MM-estimation combines high breakdown point with high "
"efficiency."
msgstr ""
"Huberは外れ値の重みを徐々に小さくします。バイスクエア(Tukey)は極端な外れ値を"
"完全に除外できます。MM推定は、高い崩壊点と高い効率を兼ね備えます。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "M-estimation (Huber)"
msgstr "M推定(Huber)"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "M-estimation (Bisquare)"
msgstr "M推定(バイスクエア)"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "MM-estimation"
msgstr "MM推定"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "統計量"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Coefficients"
msgstr "係数"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Estimates"
msgstr "推定値"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Display the estimated regression coefficients with standard errors, Wald t-"
"statistics, and p-values."
msgstr "回帰係数の推定値を、標準誤差、Waldのt統計量、p値とあわせて表示します。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Confidence intervals"
msgstr "信頼区間"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Display Wald-type confidence intervals for the regression coefficients at "
"the chosen confidence level."
msgstr "選んだ信頼水準で、回帰係数のWald型の信頼区間を表示します。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Descriptives"
msgstr "記述統計量"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Per-variable sample size, trimmed mean, median, Winsorized standard "
"deviation, and median absolute deviation for the dependent variable and each "
"covariate. The trimming proportion is used only for these descriptives; the "
"robust regression fit itself uses the chosen estimation method."
msgstr ""
"従属変数と各共変量について、変数ごとのサンプルサイズ、トリム平均、中央値、"
"ウィンザー化標準偏差、中央絶対偏差を表示します。トリミングの割合は、この記述"
"統計量にだけ使います。ロバスト回帰の当てはめ自体には、選んだ推定方法を使いま"
"す。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Trimming proportion"
msgstr "トリミングの割合"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Trimming proportion used for the trimmed mean and Winsorized SD in the "
"descriptives table. Default is 0.2."
msgstr ""
"記述統計量の表のトリム平均とウィンザー化標準偏差に使うトリミングの割合です。"
"既定は0.2です。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "プロット"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Residual Plots"
msgstr "残差プロット"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Residuals vs. fitted"
msgstr "残差とあてはめ値"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals against fitted values with a loess smoother to inspect non-"
"linearity or heteroscedasticity that survives the robust fit."
msgstr ""
"残差をあてはめ値に対してプロットし、loess平滑化曲線を加えます。ロバストな当て"
"はめのあとにも残る非線形性や不等分散を調べられます。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Q-Q plot of residuals"
msgstr "残差のQ-Qプロット"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Normal quantile-quantile plot of the standardised residuals to assess the "
"residual distribution."
msgstr "標準化残差の正規Q-Qプロットです。残差の分布を評価できます。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Other Plots"
msgstr "その他のプロット"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Robust weights"
msgstr "ロバストな重み"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Shows the weight assigned to each observation during estimation. "
"Downweighted observations (weight < 1) indicate potential outliers."
msgstr ""
"推定で各観測に割り当てられた重みを表示します。重みが小さくなった観測(重み < "
"1)は、外れ値の可能性があることを示します。"
